Slide 6: Connecting to the Real World (MCP)
Speaker Note: Agents become "supercharged" when you connect them to live data using the Model Context Protocol (MCP)
. This allows your agent to query your actual databases, check GitHub issues, or pull cloud metadata in real-time
. You just list the MCP server in the agent's frontmatter, and it becomes part of their toolset
.

