Slide 7: Sequential Workflows (Handoffs)
Speaker Note: One of the most powerful features is Handoffs
. You can chain agents together to create a "guided workflow"
. For example, a "Planning" agent can generate a strategy and then provide a "Handoff" button that passes the context to an "Implementation" agent to write the code
.

